<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-epitaph-wangyi" book-id="b-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts" chapter-id="c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts" source-id="s-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts-rubbing-reproduction">
  <p id="c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p000" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">領國子祭酒濟州刺史<persName id="c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p000:m0009" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAA">王使君</persName>墓誌</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">祖諱<persName id="c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p001:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>，齊故尚書左僕射、使持節、鎮北將軍、雍州刺史。夫人陳郡殷氏，父道矜，太中大夫。父諱<persName id="c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p001:m0044" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAA">琛</persName>，齊故司徒從事中郎。夫人彭城劉氏，嘉興縣主，父義恭，宋太宰江夏王。公諱<persName id="c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p001:m0080" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAA">翊</persName>，字<persName id="c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p001:m0083" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAA">仕翔</persName>，徐州琅耶郡臨沂縣都鄉南仁里人也。</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">春秋卌有五，永安元年歲在戊申十二月壬午朔廿日辛丑終於位。</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p003" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">二年歲次己酉二月癸未朔廿七日己酉窆於洛陽西鄉里。</p>
</text>
